> -- 

It says that you feel "very firm" to indicate that you have resistance
to that ability normally associated with the monster you just consumed.
Generally, when one gets a (somewhat) cryptic message following the 
consumption of a monster corpse it is to indicate that an intrinsic
ability has been gained (which is usually associated with the special
attribute of that particular monster).

